OL,3,GNEWSARoad crash victims remembered at
OL,4,Aannual services
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoad crash victims have been remembered
OL,7,Fat annual church services organised by
OL,8,Fthe police.
OL,10,FTwo services were hosted earlier by the
OL,11,FJoint Operations Roads Policing Unit,
OL,12,Fwhich covers Hampshire, the Isle of
OL,13,FWight and the Thames Valley.
OL,15,FDozens of relatives and friends
OL,16,Fgathered at Christ Church, Winchester,
OL,17,Fand at St Mary the Virgin Church, in
OL,18,FThame, Oxfordshire.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
